@startuml
title Smart Campus - Domain Class Diagram

class Student {
    - studentId: String
    - name: String
    + viewAvailability(startTime, endTime)
    + bookRoom(room: Room, startTime, duration)
    + cancelBooking(booking: Booking)
}

class Room {
    - roomId: String
    - name: String
    - blocked: Boolean
    + isAvailable(startTime, endTime): Boolean
}

class Booking {
    - bookingId: String
    - startTime: DateTime
    - duration: Duration
    - status: BookingStatus
    + overlaps(startTime, endTime): Boolean
    + cancel()
}

class Administrator {
    - administratorId: String
    - name: String
    + blockRoom(room: Room)
    + unblockRoom(room: Room)
    + reviewUsage(startDate, endDate)
}

enum BookingStatus {
    ACTIVE
    CANCELLED
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : reserved for >

note right of Booking
R1: startTime must be in the future.
duration > 0 and <= 2 hours.

R2: Active bookings for the
same Room cannot overlap.
Assumption A1: Intervals are half-open [start, end).
Touching bookings are allowed.
endTime = startTime + duration.
US-03: cancel() is permitted only for the owning Student.
Cancelled records are retained for usage review (US-05).
end note

note right of Room
R3: A blocked Room cannot
accept a new Booking.
Assumption A2: Blocking keeps existing bookings.
Cancelled bookings release their time slot.
end note

note bottom of Booking
R4: A successful booking
produces a confirmation.
end note

@enduml
